command-description-persistence-saveworld =
    Saves the persistent world, along with every character currently in the round.
command-description-persistence-savechar =
    Saves the piped persistent characters to their character save files.
command-description-persistence-saveentity =
    Saves the piped entity, and everything inside it, to the given file in the server's user data.
command-description-persistence-loadentity =
    Loads a single saved entity from the given file in the server's user data, and places it where you are.
command-description-persistence-loadmap =
    Loads a saved map from the given file in the server's user data as a new map.
command-description-joingamepersist =
    Late-joins as a persistent character: loads their save if there is one, otherwise spawns them fresh and saves that. Only admins can pass false for load, which starts the character over.
